<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Ridley offer not fair-J.White.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Ridley offer not fair-J.White.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malster Joe White Maltings Ltd said on Thursday that an independent expert's report had concluded that Ridley Corporation Ltd's bid of A$5.30 per share was neither fair nor reasonable.</p>
</text>
